#!/bin/bash
# Fake curl for the calendar suites: answers PROPFINDs by URL from fixtures/,
# logs argv, and notes whether stdin carried the credentials. Exits 22 for the
# URL in $FAKE_CURL_FAIL, like curl --fail on an HTTP error.
printf '%s\n' "$*" >> "$FAKE_LOG/curl.argv"
stdin=$(cat)
[[ $stdin == *'user = "'* ]] && echo creds-on-stdin >> "$FAKE_LOG/curl.stdin"
url=${*: -1}; dir=$(dirname "$0")/../fixtures
[[ -n ${FAKE_CURL_FAIL:-} && $url == *"$FAKE_CURL_FAIL"* ]] && exit 22
case $url in
    https://caldav.icloud.com/) cat "$dir/propfind-principal.xml" ;;
    */principal/) cat "$dir/propfind-home.xml" ;;
    */calendars/) cat "$dir/propfind-calendars.xml" ;;
    *) exit 22 ;;
esac
